graph TD
    Start([Start Import]) --> Source{Import Source}
    Source -->|Folder Watcher| Watcher[Scan .adv / .adz in /adventures directory]
    Source -->|UI Upload| Upload[API: POST /adventures/import]
    
    Watcher --> LoadFile[Read File Stream / Buffer]
    Upload --> LoadFile
    
    LoadFile --> TypeCheck{File Extension?}
    TypeCheck -->|.adz| Unzip[Extract ZIP Bundle into Temp Directory]
    TypeCheck -->|.adv| ParseJSON[Parse JSON Manifest directly]
    
    Unzip --> ExtractManifest[Read and Parse adventure.adv]
    ExtractManifest --> ParseJSON
    
    ParseJSON --> Validate[Validate WorldManifesto Schema & IDs]
    Validate --> CreateTemplate[Create AdventureTemplate DB Record]
    CreateTemplate --> LocalizeAssets[Localize / Copy Assets into /data/adventures/library/{id}/]
    LocalizeAssets --> ApplyWorld[WorldManifestApplier: Seed Scenes, Entities, Exits, Quests & Awards]
    ApplyWorld --> CreateAvatar[Create Avatar & Sync Protagonist Baseline Stats]
    
    CreateAvatar --> Cleanup[Delete Temporary Files / Source File if Folder Watcher]
    Cleanup --> End([Import Complete: Template Ready])
